  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "One conversation",
      "items": [
        "bb's pinned bot thread is the bot's Bot Chat, found by title on every send (session.list title \"Bot Chat\"). bb creates it only on your first message if none exists.",
        "Both apps add turns to the same chat; each turn sees all earlier turns. No fork, no copy, no takeover."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "How Conduit's turns show",
      "items": [
        "Chat busy with a bb turn: the dashboard hands Conduit's message to the gateway queue. It runs after bb's turn and streams live in bb, tagged [Conduit].",
        "Chat idle: the dashboard runs the turn and saves it. bb reads it through Hermes' REST projection: your message at once, the reply when the turn ends; neither streams."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Known rare Hermes bugs",
      "items": [
        "Sends from both apps within about 50 ms, and a compaction that rotates the chat id, can confuse Hermes' order. No message is lost. Accepted for v1, and not filed upstream (D50)."
      ]
    }
  ]
